WEBVTT

00:02:59.575 --> 00:03:01.195
Men: “hursand salomlashish”

00:03:01.219 --> 00:03:03.016
haqida gapiryapman,

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.283
shu 4 bandni bajarsak,
so'zlarimizni albatta

00:03:05.307 --> 00:03:06.879
to'gri qabul qilishadi.

00:03:06.903 --> 00:03:08.401
Demak,harflarning ma’nosi nima?

00:03:08.425 --> 00:03:09.801
Ko’ramiz, payqa olasizmi.

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:13.259
S – samimiylik,

00:03:13.283 --> 00:03:16.230
rostgo’y, to’g’ri so’z va
tushunarli bo’lish degani.

00:03:16.254 --> 00:03:20.271
H – haqiqiylik. Haqiqiy bo’lish.

00:03:20.295 --> 00:03:23.481
Mening do’stim buni insonning
haqiqiy timsoli deb tariflagan,

00:03:23.505 --> 00:03:25.419
menimcha, bu juda qiziqdir.

00:03:25.443 --> 00:03:28.055
H – halollik. So’zda turish,

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:29.843
etgan narsalarni qilish,

00:03:29.867 --> 00:03:31.697
ishonchli odam bo’lish.